    <string name="accessibility_label">Dynamic Droid island</string>
    <string name="accessibility_description">Places the island above the status bar, uses app package names to detect app switches, and lets the volume keys show the volume island. Only the volume keys are checked; every other key passes through untouched. If you turn on hiding the phone\'s pop-ups, it also finds the system\'s pop-up for a notification the island is showing and swipes it into the shade; it looks only at System UI for that and nothing else on screen. It never captures screenshots.</string>
